WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:09.384
Species are decided
the moment they're born,

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:12.470
so they want a purpose they can accept.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:16.474
You're a tough one to chew on.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:20.145
This will be the end, kid.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:24.274
Yes, I agree.

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:29.487
I've started to realize, Jack,

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:33.366
the purpose of being born a wolf.

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:38.163
I probably shouldn't be
showing this to you.

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:43.668
I'm sorry, Hal.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.513
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:05.690
These nails are for you.
These fangs are for you.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:09.527
I'll be your beast.

00:01:30.381 --> 00:01:32.884
Do I look like a devil to you?

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:37.555
Hal. It's all right now.

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:41.101
You're free to decide.

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:45.897
Would you run away with me?

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.068
Legoshi.

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:55.907
Would you tame this gray wolf?

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.910
My body's shivering.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.465
I'm glad.

00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:14.342
Really.

00:02:18.513 --> 00:02:19.764
Legoshi.

00:02:22.851 --> 00:02:25.353
I came this far wanting to be forgiven...

00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:28.815
for the fact that I was born a carnivore.

00:02:30.441 --> 00:02:32.026
That I'm in love with you.

